/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (The\040Management\040of\040Intellectual\040Property\072\040Introduction)
/Author (Derek\040Bosworth)
/Subject (The\040present\040book\040brings\040together\04015\040chapters\040by\040economists\054\040managerial\040scientists\054\040accountants\040and\040lawyers\040on\040different\040dimensions\040of\040the\040management\040of\040intellectual\040property\040\050IP\051\040and\054\040by\040implication\054\040intellectual\040property\040rights\040\050IPRs\051\056\040Management\040could\054\040in\040principle\054\040imply\040management\040by\040government\040as\040well\040as\040by\040companies\056\040In\040practice\054\040the\040focus\040of\040the\040present\040contributions\040is\040on\040private\040sector\040issues\040such\040as\040the\040private\040costs\040and\040benefi\040ts\040of\040alternative\040strategies\054\040rather\040than\040on\040how\040the\040government\040or\040international\040bodies\040manage\040\050or\040should\040manage\051\040IPRs\056\040Almost\040without\040exception\054\040the\040discussion\040considers\040company\040and\040organizational\040issues\040within\040the\040context\040of\040the\040existing\040IPR\040framework\056\040Thus\054\040the\040optimal\040design\040of\040the\040framework\040of\040IP\040laws\040lies\040well\040outside\040the\040bounds\040of\040the\040present\040book\056\040In\040principle\054\040IP\040covers\040the\040creative\040activities\040of\040literary\054\040artistic\040and\040scientifi\040c\040works\073\040performances\040of\040performing\040artists\054\040phonograms\040and\040broadcasts\073\040inventions\040in\040all\040fi\040elds\040of\040human\040endeavour\073\040scientifi\040c\040discoveries\073\040industrial\040designs\073\040trademarks\054\040service\040marks\054\040and\040commercial\040names\040and\040designations\073\040protection\040against\040unfair\040competition\073\040and\040all\040other\040rights\040resulting\040from\040intellectual\040activity\040in\040the\040industrial\054\040scientifi\040c\054\040literary\040or\040artistic\040fi\040elds\040\050WIPO\054\0401967\054\040Article\0402\050viii\051\051\056\040The\040present\040book\054\040in\040principle\040at\040least\054\040has\040a\040somewhat\040broader\040focus\040than\040some\040of\040the\040earlier\040attempts\040to\040explore\040the\040management\040of\040IP\054\040which\040have\040tended\040to\040focus\040on\040patents\040and\040patent\055related\040IPRs\040\050for\040example\054\040Granstrand\054\0401999\051\056\040Patenting\040remains\040an\040important\040dimension\040of\040the\040present\040discussion\054\040but\040there\040is\040some\040coverage\040of\040the\040trade\040and\040service\040marks\054\040as\040well\040as\040an\040attempt\040to\040place\040them\040in\040the\040broader\040context\040of\040other\040forms\040of\040IP\040and\040IPRs\056\040The\040discussion\040in\040this\040chapter\040does\040not\040dwell\040on\040the\040different\040forms\040of\040IPRs\073\040these\040are\040made\040clear\040in\040Chapter\0402\040\050although\040not\040every\040form\040of\040IPR\040is\040considered\051\040as\040well\040as\040when\040they\040are\040discussed\040in\040various\040other\040chapters\040\050for\040example\054\040Chapter\0407\051\056\040In\040addition\054\040the\040present)
